WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A runner on third changes what you watch before the pitch.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Think about the outs, the runner, and the time for a throw.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
A quickly fielded grounder may give you a sure out at first.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
A slow play may leave the batter safe before you can throw.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Then watch the runner and avoid a late throw with no purpose.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
There is no answer for every grounder. Read this play and choose.
